Field Type Description <code>downloaded_count</code> <code>int</code> Total number of successfully downloaded and decoded text files. <code>skipped_count</code> <code>int</code> Legacy counter tracking skipped items (defaults to <code>0</code>). <code>skipped_files</code> <code>list</code> Legacy container for skipped file paths (defaults to <code>[]</code>). <code>base_path</code> <code>str | None</code> Subdirectory path used when calculating relative paths; <code>None</code> if <code>use_relative_paths</code> is disabled or during SSH clones. <code>include_patterns</code> <code>set[str] | str | None</code> The set of glob patterns used for file inclusion. <code>exclude_patterns</code> <code>set[str] | str | None</code> The set of glob patterns used for file exclusion. <code>source</code> <code>str</code> (Optional) Present in the SSH pipeline, set to <code>"ssh_clone"</code>. <code>error</code> <code>str</code> (Optional) Present when an SSH clone operation fails, containing the error message. <p>Example Return Value: <pre><code>{
    "files": {
        "src/core.py": "import os\n\ndef init():\n    pass\n",
        "README.md": "# Project Core\nDocumentation goes here.\n"
    },
    "stats": {
        "downloaded_count": 2,
        "skipped_count": 0,
        "skipped_files": [],
        "base_path": "src",
        "include_patterns": {"*.py", "*.md"},
        "exclude_patterns": {"*test*"},
        "source": "ssh_clone"
    }
}
</code></pre></p>
